                                        "value": "<div><font size=\"+1\"><b>Type</font></b><br><font color='#949495'>Base primitive noise. Available values: OpenSimplex2,\nOpenSimplex2S, Perlin, Perlin (billow), Perlin (half), Value,\nValue (cubic), Value (delaunay), Value (linear), Worley, Worley\n(doube), Worley (value).</div>"
