                                    "ui.tooltip": {
                                        "metadata": {
                                            "snapshot_manager": {
                                                "snapshots": {}
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "type": "std::string",
                                        "value": "<div><font size=\"+1\"><b>Periodic (tileable)</font></b><br><font color='#949495'>When enabled the noise is made tileable: the lattice is wrapped\nat a period derived from kw, and kw is snapped to integer cells\nso the wrap aligns with the noise frequency. Applies to lattice\nnoise types only (no effect on Simplex); seamless fbm tiling\nadditionally requires an integer lacunarity (the default 2).</div>"
                                    },
